---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Fresh Petals Hyderabad"
  description="Fresh Petals Hyderabad privacy policy for customer information, WhatsApp orders, delivery details and website usage."
>
  <main class="bg-white">
    <section class="px-5 py-12 md:px-8 md:py-16">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl">
        <div class="mb-10 text-center">
          <p class="fp-eyebrow">
            Fresh Petals Hyderabad
          </p>

          <h1 class="fp-h1 mt-3">
            Privacy Policy
          </h1>

          <p class="mx-auto mt-5 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-7 text-[#66565D] md:text-base">
            This policy explains how Fresh Petals Hyderabad may collect and use customer information for flower orders, delivery coordination and service communication.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-5">
          <section class="rounded-[24px] border border-[#EEE5E8] bg-[#FFF8FA] p-6">
            <h2 class="text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-[#171717]">
              Information We Collect
            </h2>

            <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-[#66565D]">
              When you place an order or enquiry, we may collect your name, phone number, WhatsApp number, delivery address, pincode, order details, delivery date, time slot, payment confirmation details and any notes shared by you.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="rounded-[24px] border border-[#EEE5E8] bg-white p-6 shadow-[0_10px_30px_rgba(40,24,32,0.05)]">
            <h2 class="text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-[#171717]">
              How We Use Your Information
            </h2>

            <div class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm leading-7 text-[#66565D]">
              <p>We use customer information only for order-related purposes such as:</p>

              <ul class="space-y-2">
                <li>• Confirming flower availability and final price</li>
                <li>• Coordinating delivery and address confirmation</li>
                <li>• Sharing payment details or payment confirmation</li>
                <li>• Handling order updates, replacements or support</li>
                <li>• Improving our product, delivery and customer experience</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="rounded-[24px] border border-[#EEE5E8] bg-[#FFF8FA] p-6">
            <h2 class="text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-[#171717]">
              WhatsApp Communication
            </h2>

            <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-[#66565D]">
              Fresh Petals currently uses WhatsApp as the primary ordering and confirmation channel. By sending an order or enquiry through WhatsApp, you agree to receive order-related messages from us regarding availability, delivery, payment and support.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="rounded-[24px] border border-[#EEE5E8] bg-white p-6 shadow-[0_10px_30px_rgba(40,24,32,0.05)]">
            <h2 class="text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-[#171717]">
              Payment Information
            </h2>

            <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-[#66565D]">
              We do not ask you to enter card or banking details directly on this website. If payment is required, payment instructions or UPI/payment confirmation details may be shared through WhatsApp. Avoid sharing sensitive banking passwords, OTPs or PINs with anyone.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="rounded-[24px] border border-[#EEE5E8] bg-[#FFF8FA] p-6">
            <h2 class="text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-[#171717]">
              Website Cart Data
            </h2>

            <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-[#66565D]">
              The website may use browser local storage to remember products added to your cart. This helps you review selected products before sending the order on WhatsApp. This cart data is stored in your browser and can be cleared by clearing the cart or browser data.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="rounded-[24px] border border-[#EEE5E8] bg-white p-6 shadow-[0_10px_30px_rgba(40,24,32,0.05)]">
            <h2 class="text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-[#171717]">
              Sharing of Information
            </h2>

            <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-[#66565D]">
              We do not sell customer information. We may share order-related information only with people involved in fulfilling the order, such as delivery partners, sourcing partners or internal team members, when required for delivery and service completion.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="rounded-[24px] border border-[#EEE5E8] bg-[#FFF8FA] p-6">
            <h2 class="text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-[#171717]">
              Data Accuracy
            </h2>

            <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-[#66565D]">
              Customers are responsible for sharing accurate name, phone number, address, pincode and delivery instructions. Fresh Petals is not responsible for failed or delayed delivery caused by incorrect or incomplete customer information.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="rounded-[24px] border border-[#EEE5E8] bg-white p-6 shadow-[0_10px_30px_rgba(40,24,32,0.05)]">
            <h2 class="text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-[#171717]">
              Policy Updates
            </h2>

            <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-[#66565D]">
              This privacy policy may be updated as Fresh Petals improves its website, ordering flow, delivery process or payment options. Updated policies will be published on this page.
            </p>
          </section>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-10 rounded-[24px] border border-[#E8D8DE] bg-[#FFF8FA] p-6 text-center">
          <h2 class="text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-[#171717]">
            Privacy question?
          </h2>

          <p class="mx-auto mt-3 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-7 text-[#66565D]">
            Contact Fresh Petals on WhatsApp for order or privacy-related questions.
          </p>

          <a
            href="https://wa.me/919652012274?text=Hi%20Fresh%20Petals%2C%20I%20have%20a%20question%20about%20privacy%20or%20my%20order%20details."
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="mt-6 inline-flex rounded-full bg-[#075838] px-7 py-4 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-white transition hover:bg-[#7C243E]"
          >
            Contact on WhatsApp
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>